[I] A neat and simple webcam app

[T] fswebcam is a small command line webcam program that captures frames
[T] from V4L or V4L2 devices, averages them to reduce noise and draws a
[T] caption on the image. The image is then saved as PNG, JPEG or WEBP using
[T] the GD library.

[U] https://www.sanslogic.co.uk/fswebcam/

[A] Fswebcam Authors
